 └► app/models.py                     User.journey_data keeps the answer
 └► engine.goto(next)                 next question, e.g. t("demo.book_ask_detail")
     └► app/demo/niches.py            {book_ask_detail} = booking.ask_detail of the chosen niche
 [A0 OUT]  the next question
 ↳ a restaurant asks "How many guests...", a clinic asks "Which treatment..."; a bad email is asked again


A7. LAST FORM ANSWER → LEAD SAVED   ("Friday 8:30 pm" for a table booking)
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 [A0 IN]
 └► app/journeys/engine.py            input saves book_when → goto("book_submit") → _enter() → action
     └► self.actions["crm.create_lead"]                   (registered in ACTIONS)
 └► app/journeys/actions.py           create_lead()
     └► builds the interest text from the node's template + Niche.params("en"):
        "[DEMO BOOKING] Restaurant / Cafe / The Spice Route Kitchen: 4 people, birthday, when: Friday 8:30 pm"
     └► app/crm/providers.py          CRM_PROVIDER: local (nothing more) · hubspot (contact)
