A8. ASKS FOR A HUMAN   (taps "Talk to a human", or types "human" / "agent")
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 [A0 IN]
 └► app/journeys/engine.py            goto("handoff") → action "handoff.start"
 └► app/journeys/actions.py           start_handoff(): User.handoff = True
     └► app/crm/providers.py          log_event("handoff.requested")
                                      webhook CRM POSTs it (you get an alert); local / HubSpot only log it
