A9. WRITES WHILE A HUMAN HAS THE CHAT
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 [A0 IN]  (the message is still saved, so staff can read it)
 └► app/services/conversation.py      user.handoff is True → the engine is NOT called
     typed "bot" / "menu" / "robot"... (resume_keywords in demo.yaml)
        → User.handoff = False, t("handoff.ended")  "You're back with the virtual assistant 🤖"
        → engine.goto(home) → menu
     anything else → no reply
 [A0 OUT]  only when resumed; the customer still sees blue ticks either way
 ↳ the bot never talks over your staff, and the customer can always get the bot back


